We check that $a_1 = 1 + \left(\frac{1}{2} - 1\right)^2 = \frac{1}{4},$ $a_2 = 1 + \left(\frac{1}{4} - 1\right)^2 = \frac{13}{16},$ and $a_3 =1 + \left(\frac{13}{16} - 1\right)^2 = \frac{1969}{256}.$

